# Skrelv, Defector Mite: "{W/P}, {T}: Choose a color. Another target creature you control gains toxic 1 and hexproof from
# that color until end of turn. It can't be blocked by creatures of that color this turn." (CR 702.164, 702.11d, 509.1b).
# On Bot1's turn 3 Skrelv's {W/P} is paid with a Plains (the pool is empty right after) and white is chosen for Memnite.
# Skrelv itself and Bot2's Devoted Hero are not targets; Bot2's Swords to Plowshares (white) can't target Memnite and
# Devoted Hero (white) can't block it, so it connects: Bot2 loses 1 life and gets a poison counter (toxic 1 granted, not
# the printed one). On turn 4 the effects are over - Memnite has no toxic and no restriction - and Swords to Plowshares
# exiles Memnite.

